The '''Indra Island''' is an [[Locations|island]] in the [[Second Sea]].

==Location==
The Indra Island can be found in the [[Second Sea]], at about 2,500 meters away from the [[Forgotten Island]].

==Inhabitant==
[[rip_indra]] is the only inhabitant of the Indra Island.

==Notes==
* In the [[Castle on the Sea]], the player can talk to [[Erin]] to watch the battle cutscene located at the Indra Island again.
* In order to normally access the Indra Island, the player has to talk to [[King Red Head]] in the [[Colosseum (Second Sea)]] and he will teleport them to this island.

==Trivia==
[[File:Indra island view.png|thumb|250px|Indra Island being around 2580m away from [[Forgotten Island]] according to the [[Recommended Quest|compass]].]]
* As of [[Updates/20|Update 20]], when talking to [[Erin]] and the cutscene plays, the Indra Island can be seen inside of [[Sea Danger Level|Sea Danger Level 4]] '''<font color="red">(Extreme)</font>''' as rocks appear. Although it's located ~1940m away from [[Tiki Outpost]], it can only be seen by the player who started the cutscene.
* The Indra Island has no official name, so it was given one by the community.
* Like the [[Remote Island]] and [[Cave Island]], this island is also not considered an actual "island". So, using flying boats such as the [[Miracle]], players can land on the ground of the island itself.

